Z||000005||Simple Fiero||08-01-2001||01:16 AM||||I am from BC and there are a ton of courses here for u to play. There is Predator and Spallumchem(I believe that is what it is called) they are both located in vernon(used to live there)I live in kelowna now. As for Golf  I suck at it. Play once a yr lol(company tourney). But as for finding a course you shouldn't have a problem. If you see me driving around wave, lol. <P>white 88 coupe with green trim. <BR>Have a blast here in the Okanagan.||||reg||6
