Z||000007||RiceCooker||08-02-2001||01:25 PM||||Hey everyone I'm Here!<P>The trip went well pretty uneventful and alot of driving fun. <BR>saw a couple notchback coupes on the highway and a sweet yellow GT in Kelowna. Gave him alittle wave but seems he was either just checkin out my car or too cool. <P>Overcast skies so far so no golfin but i will. I'm staying in Walnut Grove in Langley and it's absolutely beautiful. I dont want to go home.<P>Well that's all for now. Neverfinished i may call you next week. I'll be in Armstrong on Wednesday and Thursday.<P>Later gang0.<BR>Todd||||reg||6
