Z||000010||Capt Fiero||08-05-2001||05:48 PM||||Ok so I am a little late on catching up with this.  How long are you gonna be here, West Coast Fiero's of BC has a car club meeting on Saturday the 11th and hopefully a drive on the 12th of August.   I live in Surrey right next to Langley, if you wanna hook up and chat, feel free to give me a buzz at home 507-7754.  I wish I would known you were in town already, a few of us Fiero Nuts had an improptu meeting last night 4-5 cars went out to a local lounge and had pizza then went out to watch the local street races. My girlfriend even took here fiero for a boot down the track and blew the doors off of someguy before she even got out of first gear.  ||||reg||1
Z||000011||RiceCooker||08-07-2001||10:59 AM||||I'm leaving tomorrow (weds) for Armstrong.<P>I'm gonna be golfing this morning but I'll give you a call Capt Fiero. Only thing is, what's your real name?<P>phone conversation:<BR>"Hello?"<BR>"Hello. Is Capt Fierothere please?"<BR>"Who?"<BR>"Capt Fiero. I know he is an actor"<BR>"Who IS this?"<BR>"This is RiceCooker"<BR>"GET LOST YOU PSYCHO"<P>lol<P>Actually my names Todd I'll give you a call capt fiero. <BR>And neverfinished i will head thru your car wash tomorrow between 1 and 3 in the afternoon. What's your name? This will be funny.<P>I talked to a guy here in Langley yesterday. He had a sweet 88 coupe and it was red. He says he's part of the BC fieros thing but doubt he is here on the forum. He was heading to save on foods with his wife but as soon as he saw my tags (Alberta) he was thru talking to me.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>See ya ||||reg||6
